  "question": "Where can I find caf\u00e9 inside 170 kilometers as I travel from African American Cultural Garden, Cleveland, OH toward Mentor Civic Arena, Mentor, OH?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.629472 41.530044)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.332139 41.698458)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.629472 41.530044)',4326)::geography, 170000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.629472 41.530044)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
